msgid "``em.vocab`` — vocabularies and packages"
msgstr ""

msgid "Generated for em API |api| from the docstrings of :mod:`s3dgraphy.em.vocab`."
msgstr ""

msgid "Vocabularies, qualia and community packages — the same everywhere (SPEC-plugin §2.2)."
msgstr ""

msgid "``em.vocab`` reads the vocabulary MANAGER of this machine (:mod:`s3dgraphy.vocabularies`, W20): a concept by its URI with its labels — in the language asked, else through a VERIFIED alignment (the way stratigraph-templates' renderer does), else none (a label is never invented); a search that proposes candidates and never decides."
msgstr ""

msgid "``em.profiles`` reads the packages: the ones the open document declares (the host's overlay, ``header.profiles``), the ones installed on the machine, and the merged views of the library (qualia, extractor types with their geometry, landmark sets, combiners)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Bases: :py:class:`object`"
msgstr ""

msgid "``em.vocab`` — the vocabularies installed on this machine."
msgstr ""

msgid "A concept is read by its URI, with its labels; a search proposes candidates. A label is never invented: when no installed vocabulary has it, the answer is None."
msgstr ""

